window.products.push({"id":634095,"name":"Kentsky 50 inches Electric Fireplace Inserts, Recessed and Wall Mounted Fireplace Heater, Linear Fireplace w/Thermostat, Remote & Touch Screen, Multic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v0TpPAgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Overall Dimension: 50\"L X 5.9\"D X 17.7\"H. The electric fireplace inserts dimension: 45.7\" - 50\"L X 6\"D X 17.05\" - 17.72\"H. 5.5 inch of wide provides the enough internal space for better ventilation and air circulation, and heat up the room rapidly. 13×13 Flame and Bed Colors: The electric fireplace heater has multiple flame and LED fuel bed flame colors can be adjusted to match multiple environment and atmosphere. Coming with logs and crystals for DIY, coordinate with realistic flame create more intuitive for the people experience the real scene. Simple Operation: The electric fireplace designed with both touch screen and remote control, including: power on/off, 1-9 hours timer setting, temperature setting, heat setting, flame and fuel bed flame color setting. All function with individual button make it more easily using. Featured a display show the function choiced enable you to reach demand quickly and coveniently. Temperature & 2 Heat Setting: 750W and 1500W heat modes provide more choice according for the temperature and energy saving purpose, the heating function can be turn off with decorating flame and light on. Temperature control system can keep the room temperature between 62°F to 99°F. The wall fireplace is great for creating a cozy environment with low noise. Notice: The temperature setting can be changed between °F and °C with pressing the button for 10 seconds. Recessed & Wall Mounted Installation: This black linear fireplace can be recessed in wall or hang on the wall without taking up too much space, just assemble the brackets for wall mounting or dismantle the brackets for inserting. Perfect for living room, bedroom, dining room, study, office and other occasions. Safety and Warranty: The electric fireplace have overheating protection will cut off automatically when reach unsafe temperature(212°F). Please leave 8\" of space between fireplace and TV. 1 year warranty and 24 hours customer service, if you have any question, pls feel free contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v0TpPAgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kentsky","source_asin":"B0C5R7MSQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5R7MSQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5R7MSQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
