window.products.push({"id":634170,"name":"4 Pack Digital Kitchen Timer, ON/Off Switch, Large LCD Display Loud Alarm and Magnetic Backing Stand, Classroom Timers for Cooking Baking Teachers Kid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+gwZc-mYL._AC_SL1201_.jpg","description":"<b>STRONG SOUNDING ALARM - - </b>Comes with ON/OFF Switch. Powered by 1*AAA battery (not Included ) . Loud & clear sound but not deafening. The alarm sound can be heard from another room. The alarm sound normaly lasts for 60sec until you press \"ST/SP\" button to stop,Included White-Pink-Blue-Green timers. <b>LARGE LCD SCREEN AND BIG DIGITS - - </b>With bigger and clearer 2 inches LCD screen, this kitchen timer can simple to read the time and bold numbers across the room.Maximum time is 99 minutes, 59 seconds.Push and hold button over 3 seconds then the time will fast forward, adjust to zero by just pressing the \"M\" and \"S\" button at the same time <b>COUNTS UP AND DOWN - - </b>As well as a countdown timer and minute timer this can also act as a stopwatch counting up from zero. Perfect timer for homework, exercise, gym workout, cooking ( egg timer ), sports, games and classroom timer activities. <b>MAGNETIC BACK, RETRACTABLE STAND AND HOOK FOR HANGING - - </b>You have 3 different choices for placement of the Kitchen Timer. Either stick it to the fridge door with its large magnet, or use the pull out stand for table-top use, and finally you can run a piece of string through the hook and hang it on a wall hook or around your neck. <b>GUARANTEED -- </b> If you are not absolutely satisfied with our timer or if there is any issues, please feel free to contact us. We will refund or replace it for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+gwZc-mYL._AC_SL1201_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rumcnjen","source_asin":"B08QS8XH2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QS8XH2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QS8XH2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634171,"name":"PABIPABI 4 Packs Lighted Birch Tree 24 LED 24'' Money Tree Small Bonsai Tree Artificial Tree Lights Battery Powered Timer Warm White Mini Table Top Tr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ogq7x9clL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎈【Table Centerpieces】You will receive 4 2FT tall small birch trees with a 4 \"x4\" square detachable base and 24 warm white LED lights on the branches. In addition, the branches are adjustable and can be adjusted to any desired shape according to your preferences. Exquisite design, simple and versatile appearance, making it a very practical tabletop decoration. 🎈【Battery Powered】Our birch tree is battery powered (excluding batteries), which means that after installing the batteries on your own, the small tree can be placed freely in the position you want to decorate, making it easier to achieve the desired effect. The location for installing the battery is in the square base position, and the control switch is located above the button on the base, which you can easily see. 🎈【Timer Function】The birch tree has a convenient timing function. Our timing function is designed to open and close within 6 hours and 18 hours. You can set the timing function in advance when needed, so that the small tree will be closed when you are out or not in use, helping you save time and resources~ 🎈【Flexible Branch】The branches of the small white birch tree are in a curved and adjustable state, so you can DIY the shape you want when using it. You can also bring some lightweight accessories for decoration, which makes it more vivid and adds a sense of atmosphere. Of course, the more you look at the small tree you decorate yourself, the more you will like it!! 🎈【Multi Function】Our small trees are perfect for daily home, office, and holiday decorations. You can place our small trees on your desk, dining room, living room, bedroom, and other places. You can also enhance the atmosphere during specific holidays such as Christmas, Easter, Halloween, and even weddings or parties. Such a cute and versatile little tree can make you feel happy everywhere!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ogq7x9clL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PABIPABI","source_asin":"B0C3H3N28B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3H3N28B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3H3N28B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
