window.products.push({"id":634421,"name":"Dssm Cotton Linen Tablecloths, Tassel Rectangle Table Cloth Wrinkle Free Anti-Fading Table Cover Decoration for Kitchen Dinning Party Christmas (55X70","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PV-pakXrL._AC_SL1224_.jpg","description":"Cotton Base Fabric Soft and versatile, natural feel, easy to clean.This stitching tassel tablecloth is prepared from heavy weight cotton linen fiber, it is available in multiple finishes. Ultra soft and comfortable, natural skin-friendly that is perfect for any occasion and everyday dining. Each tablecloth is beautifully tailored Usage Scenario The stitching tassel tablecloth comes in square or rectangular or round sizes to help you match the kitchen, dining room, gathering, or other outdoor living space. Friends and visitors will be impressed by this wonderful table setting. Wear Resistant, Shrink-Proof Seamless one-piece design is processed in a fashion that makes the table cover shrink proof, wear resistant, durable enough. Smooth surface and crisp texture which is very soothing to the eyes, not only is this an elegant addition to your dining table but is also a great gift for a cherished someone. How to Choose the Right-Size Tablecloth For Dining Table: Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 16\" ~ 24\"(40 ~ 60 cm) Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 16\" ~ 24\"(40 ~ 60 cm) Each end drops approximately 8\" ~ 12\" (20 ~ 30 cm) For Tea Table: Tablecloth Length=Table Length + 8\" ~ 16\"(20 ~ 40 cm) Tablecloth Width=Table Width + 8\" ~ 16\"(20 ~ 40 cm) each end drops approximately 4\" ~ 8\"(10 ~ 20 cm) Warm Tips Please measure your tabletop dimensions of length and width before purchasing the tablecloth.Please allow 0.4” ~ 0.8” (1 ~ 2 cm) error due to manual measurement.Due to shooting light and computer monitor and other reasons will cause some color differences, please refer to the actual product colorAfter long-distance transportation, the tablecloth may have some odor, it is recommended to hang it in a ventilated environment before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PV-pakXrL._AC_SL1224_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dssm","source_asin":"B08ZSWFNKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZSWFNKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZSWFNKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
