window.products.push({"id":634475,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Toco Toucan by Michael Jackson, 10x19-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+jWdC31lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a toucan leaning off of a tree. Prominent Colors: Blue, Green, Brown, Black, Grey, Tan, Yellow Michael Jackson Painting in studio his degree in Natural History Illustration. After working for five years as an advertising illustrator and part-time teacher, he took the decision to devote his time and energies to become the specialist in wildlife and portraiture that he is today. Jacksons work reflects both classical and modern interpretations fused within one painting. His influences range from the Renaissance, the masters of the nineteenth century, and Contemporary Art. With superb technique, he infuses a harmony between the natural and the conceptual, to create works that are provocative and dramatic. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+jWdC31lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07GCLPZYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GCLPZYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GCLPZYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
