window.products.push({"id":634506,"name":"7.5ft Artificial Holiday Christmas Tree, Unlit Premium Hinged Spruce Holiday Xmas Tree with Metal Foldable Stand for Home, Office, Party Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aKXkoWYtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉Create a customized look: The thick metal trunk and stand of this Christmas tree allow you to hang your favorite ornaments and garlands for a personalized touch, adding more excitement to your holiday celebrations. 🎉Easy assembly: With only three steps, the convenient branches allow the tree to stretch automatically once placed on the ground. Straighten out the branches and achieve the best effect. 🎉High-quality material: The blades of this Christmas tree are made of high-quality PVC, making it a perfect substitute for a real tree and improving safety. 🎉Sturdy stand: Our Himimi Christmas tree uses a single screw metal stand, providing stronger support and stability compared to cheap, ordinary three screws stands. It can serve you for a long time. 🎉Endless possibilities: This unlit tree leaves the decorating to you and your family. Accentuate your living space, office, or holiday party by customizing your tree with garlands, lights, ornaments, and more. Let your imagination run wild! 🎉Multiple Uses: You can use the tree as a decoration for weddings, parties, or other events. You can also turn the tree into a craft project or use it to create wreaths or garlands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aKXkoWYtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Himimi","source_asin":"B0BJVF13PN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVF13PN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVF13PN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634507,"name":"Jersey City NJ Skyline B&W by Michael Tompsett, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvblkDWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor skyline of Jersey city, new Jersey. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvblkDWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01NCOGWRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCOGWRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCOGWRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
