window.products.push({"id":634509,"name":"Pesonlook 60PCS Chair Cover Spandex Stretch Chair Band with Buckle Slider for Wedding ,Elastic Slider Chair Sashes Bows for Wedding Party Banquet Hote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7167zMjlkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈Package Includes：60PCS spandex stretch chair cover band with buckle slider,enough quantity for your need.Our elastic slider chair sashes are made of high quality spandex and good elasticity, can fit the chair well.Shiny gold material can match with any color chair cover.These chair sashes can give your chairs a uniform and professional look. Simple to use. Make your guest impress. 🌈Size&Material:4.72inch (12cm) width X 13.7inch(35cm) length,can be stretched up to 20 inch.Fit for 13 - 20 Inch width chair back.Because of it’s highly stretchable,it is easy to put on and off.Save your effort to dress up your chair.Made of spandex shiny gold material fabric, high elasticity and durable, no-fade, no-pilling, easy to clean,water resistant. 🌈Advantage:Our chair sashes don’t need to be knotted, can be easily put on the chair. Because our product use the highly stretchable fabric, it can fit any chair with a backrest width of 14-20 inches. In addition, the back of the chair bands is decorated with a nickel-plated ring that can slide left and right, which can better decorate your chair. 🌈Reusable:Our stretch chair bands is washable and reusable,easy to clean,because it’s smooth surface,after use,you can just wipe it gently.Do not need iron,no pilling. 🌈Widely use:This elastic slider chair sashes is a great glitter decorations for wedding,birthday party,events,banquet, engagement,meeting.At the same time, we provide quality after-sales service. Please buy with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7167zMjlkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pesonlook","source_asin":"B0BDDGQT7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDGQT7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDGQT7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634510,"name":"KegLand Whirlpool Arm for 35L & 65L BrewZilla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21f9MSc2nxS._AC_.jpg","description":"Stop stirring your wort with a spoon and allow the BrewZilla's internal pump to do the work with this new Whirlpool Arm accessory. Fits both the 35L and 65L model. The whirlpool arm fits onto the existing recirculation pipe with a stainless steel male camlock fitting. The BrewZilla's internal magnetic pump will aid in circulating your wort for better hop extraction in the whirlpool stage, as well as help collect the hot break into the center of the false bottom. Whirlpooling while cooling with the immersion heat exchanger will also speed up chilling times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21f9MSc2nxS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KegLand","source_asin":"B0953YP6KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0953YP6KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0953YP6KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
