window.products.push({"id":634512,"name":"Fox Run Jelly Roll/Cookie Pan, 14in x 20in, Metallic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwHudeFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Which do you prefer? Bakeware that disappoints or bakeware that performs? This Jelly Roll/Cookie Pan is part of the Preferred Non-Stick bakeware collection, designed specifically for Fox Run. It features our exclusive premium non-stick coating, which provides quick and easy release of baked goods. This pan is made of heavy gauge carbon steel, allowing even heat distribution for exceptional baking that is backed by our 5-year warranty. Its large size makes it perfect for baking an abundance of cookies or jelly rolls, roasting vegetables, and more! Bake the preferred way, with bakeware that performs. 5 YEAR WARRANTY Fox Run Brands warrants that this bake ware will be free of defects for 5 years from date of purchase. If product does not function as warranted, return to Fox Run Brands, 1907 Stout Dr., Ivyland, PA 18974, with original purchase receipt. A replacement or similar item of equal value will be returned to you. This warranty is void if product is used commercially or is damaged by negligence or misuse. Scratches or discoloration may occur from normal use and is not subject to warranty protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwHudeFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Run","source_asin":"B081HQ43L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081HQ43L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081HQ43L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634513,"name":"Feivea Chenille Bathroom Mat Set 2 Piece Non Slip Bath Rugs Extra Soft Fluffy Washable Water Absorbent Carpet for Bathroom, Tub, Shower 24\"×17\"+32\"×20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PE9Yh0EoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Thick: The thickened chenille piles are close to each other, each chenille pile is about 1.1 inches long, fluffy and soft. When stepping on the carpet, your feet are like sinking into the clouds, surrounded by thousands of microfiber piles, so as to prevent your feet from touching the cold ground and bring you extraordinary comfort. Feivea bathroom carpet two piece set: 24\"×17\"+32\"×20\". No Falling Down: The improved feivea bathroom carpet will lock each chenille firmly, and will not fall down like other brands, and keep away from the falling objects of microfiber and will not contaminate your ground. The Carpet is composed of three layers: fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom anti skid layer. Extra Absorbent: These thick bathroom carpets can instantly absorb moisture from your feet when you step out of the bathtub or shower room, because a large amount of microfiber can keep your room floor dry and clean. Excellent Anti Skid PVC: this bathroom mat is made of environment-friendly mesh PVC material, which is different from other TPR bottom and glue bottom. PVC bottom can more effectively prevent the bathroom mat from slipping and protect you and your family. Please put the bathroom mat on a dry ground. The water under the carpet may cause it to slide. Machine Washable: It is recommended to wash in cold water and use a neutral detergent. The lines will not be scattered during machine washing and tumbling, and the super soft material will not shrink and become rough after washing. After machine washing and air drying, please shake the bath mat to make it more fluffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PE9Yh0EoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feivea","source_asin":"B0956C7TZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0956C7TZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0956C7TZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634514,"name":"OIAHOMY Laundry Basket, Laundry Hamper,Tall Cotton Storage Basket with Handles,Collapsible Large Basket for Clothes,Decorative Blanket Basket for Livi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8149H1lAFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Natural Handmade Laundry Baskets】 OIAHOMY high quality laundry hamper is made of 100% cotton, natural and healthy.In addition,this cotton rope basket is no sharp edges and a hard surface, safe for kids, elders,pets in nursery,baby room,play room,bedroom,living room.This storage basket is Nature Material, No Chemical No Nasty No Disgusting Smell,Safe for Intimate Clothing. 【Oversized Size Blanket Basket】The overall size of the storage basket is 16.5x12.6x21.6 inches.This large basket can easily accommodate the family's one-week change of clothes and keep room clean&tidy.This elegant woven storage basket bring great convenience in life to store bulky items like blankets,toys,comforters,duvets,throw pillows,cushions,stuffed animals,winter clothing etc. 【Double reinforced Handles】We use the highest grade cotton rope as raw material and all the stitches are distribution and fine,which makes the baskets better wear resistance and durability to be used for many years.In addition,each large basket features thick,double stitching around the handles to prevent ripping and keep its shape,never fall off. 【Portable Collapsible & Large Soft Hamper】Our storage basket are soft to touch, yet sturdy enough to keep shape and stand up on its own. Even when subjected to the roughest toddler play, you’ll never have to worry about the laundry hamper leaving scuff marks or dings! Generously-sized handles with reinforced stitching allow for convenient and comfortable carrying of heavy loads around the house.They are collapsible,can be easily stored when not in use or when you travel. 【Satisfaction Guarantee & Note】We have invested a lot of love and effort in designing and manufacturing the best laundry baskets for our customers, so we support our quality and craftsmanship. If you are not satisfied for any reason, please let us know and we will replace your shopping basket for free or a full refund. NOTE: The laundry hamper is folded, but it will turn back to its elegant shape quickly if you fill it with some towels or blankets, and iron is great idea to remove the creases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8149H1lAFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OIAHOMY","source_asin":"B0BR99MWRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR99MWRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR99MWRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
