window.products.push({"id":634524,"name":"Personal Air Filter To Trap Smoke Sploof & Odor - Eliminate Smoke For Roommates Relatives and Buddy I Easy To Use & Long Lasting Filters I Includes 5 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713clOmXFaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smoke Without the Guilt Do you wish you could light up without worrying that someone nearby will be forced to inhale the resulting fumes and odors? Have you given up smoking around your home, at the office or on the go, but every so often you find yourself with a craving that won’t quit? Have you tried other smoke filters that either didn’t quite do the job, were uncomfortable to use, or are simply not affordable on a regular basis? Smoke When the Mood Strikes You with this Personal Smoke Filter! With a comfortable mouthpiece, an ergonomic fit, and five extra pre-filters to extend its life, this is the smoking companion you’ve been seeking. Removes 99.97% of Particles : With the dynamic duo of activated carbon + a three-stage HEPA filter, our smoke eraser can truly clear the air and leave your environment smelling just as it did before you lit up. Fits Any Mouth : No matter the size and shape of your lips, beard or no beard, this mouthpiece allows you to form a tight seal without the hassle. The result is no smoke or unpalatable odors escaping into your environment. Built to Last : With its solid plastic construction and five included pre-filters, this must-have smoking accessory will do its job well for months at a time. Simply snap the pre-filter into the mouthpiece, enjoy your smoke, then remove the pre-filter and let it dry before your next session. Anywhere and Everywhere : Whether it’s the office, the car, the airport, or even the bedroom, this compact little filter lets you smoke when it suits you without bothering anybody else. At last, you can smoke on your terms. Order Your Personal Smoke Filter Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713clOmXFaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vonReval","source_asin":"B09B29BGLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B29BGLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B29BGLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
