window.products.push({"id":634662,"name":"Asia Wohnstudio Kapok Wedge Thai Triangle Cushion (32X32X50Cm) Filled with 100% Natural Kapok, Massage Bed Bolster/Pillow for Backrest (Red Yellow) 50","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gzu7k2U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thai cushions without folds. Triangle cushions made of pure kapok 100 % kapok Thai cushions (triangle cushions) of the Asia Wohnstudio brand Our wedge-shaped triangle cushions are the perfect companions for any bed and also for any couch. Their special form ensures a relaxed position when reading, watching TV, or for a relaxing break. Our Thai cushions are ideally suited for any kind of relaxation! Triangle cushions are the ideal companion all around well-being. Thai cushions are extremely well suited for reading, watching TV, yoga, or for simple \"relaxing\"! Unique kapok filling: Kapok of the kapok tree Our Thai cushions are also suitable for outside areas, because we have the cushions firmly filled with kapok. Due to this special plant fiber, no cold from the ground comes through. The fiber has a pleasant insulating effect in the summer. Kapok is a pure vegetable product, which we use untreated and natural for the filling. Our cushions are handmade in selected family companies and only natural and sustainable materials are used. Our Thai cushions are filled with 100% kapok and have durable cotton covers made of pure cotton. Product information Size of Thai cushion: 50 cm (length) x 30 cm (width) x 32 cm (height) Weight of Thai cushion: 2, 5 kg Filling: 100% natural kapok of the kapok tree Cover: 100% cotton. We only use pure and very durable cotton Our Thai cushions are handmade in selected family companies and imported by us directly without intermediaries! Asia Wohnstudio cushion - a sustainable quality product. Tested quality with original label","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gzu7k2U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asia Wohnstudio","source_asin":"B00F8G3LCA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F8G3LCA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F8G3LCA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
