window.products.push({"id":634700,"name":"DEMDACO Patterned Heart Pink and Green 43 x 14 Aluminum Metal Screen Door Hanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jm4P7JQGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For more than 20 years, DEMDACO has designed and sold giftable products intended to “Lift the Spirit”—in times of celebration, when comfort is needed, or just to put a smile on someone’s face. The hand-curated artisan gifts it develops and distributes are chosen for their potential to help people nurture goodness in the lives of others, celebrate family and friends, and encourage people to treat themselves. We partner with artists representing a wide range of styles and mediums, and whose work is consistent with our values. Products are curated through this filter, then carefully reproduced by skilled craftspeople around the world. Under the DEMDACO brand, product categories include Gifts, Home Décor, Entertaining, Fashion, Baby, Holiday, and Outdoors. DEMDACO also maintains a partnership with artist Susan Lordi, offering her popular Willow Tree sculptures. Patterned Heart Door Hanger features a wave and dot pattern on a long heart. Unique handcrafted pieces of indoor/outdoor art which offer a welcoming way to announce each season. Colorful, playful decorations are crafted from painted metal screen. Door Hanger is made of aluminum metal screen with pink and green wave finish. Large format and durable materials make these pieces perfect for front doors, covered porches, and entryways. Door Hanger measures approximately 43 x 14 x 1 inches. Looking for a perfect touch for your front door? This wall art is a fun way to add personality and welcome guests. Perfect for display on a door or wall to add an extra pop of fun. By Screenings Collection. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jm4P7JQGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B07HQYS8LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HQYS8LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HQYS8LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
