window.products.push({"id":634773,"name":"Quoowiit Modern Sculptures Home Decor, Sailboat Decor Ornament, Boat Decorations Statue Decor, Art Sculptures and Statues, Sailboat Gifts Home Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416++5bifHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sailboat Decor】: The smooth lines vividly construct this sailboat sculpture in a minimalist way, matched with the classic black and white color scheme, which is simple and elegant. The shuttle-shaped base not only creates a flexible and exquisite image, but also maintains the stability of the entire boat decor, allowing it to be placed on the table stably. 【2 Pack Boat Decorations】: The exquisite boat statue with the style of riding the wind and waves, represents the spirit of exploration and fearless courage, as if taking you to explore freedom at any time. 2 Pack boat decor, with the blessing of always being with you on the way forward, will take you to overcome each difficulty. The first step to success is to set sail, so placing it at home to bring you success and good luck. 【Resin Material & Size】: Hand-made with high-quality resin, this modern sculptures home decor is not only exquisite in appearance, but also environmentally friendly, tasteless, non-toxic and harmless. The surface is smooth and durable, making it a perfect complement to any home. The size of the larger sailboat ornament: 8.07\" * 2.16\" * 11.61\", the smaller sailboat: 5.51\" * 1.57\" * 8.27\". 【Multi-Space Application】: This high-quality hand-cast statues and sculptures artwork create simple and abstract sailboats, which make you feel like you are on the sea, rushing through the wind and waves, evoke the feeling of the sea in your space. It is an ideal choice for home decoration, office, gallery, bar, coffee shop or shop window decoration. 【Perfect Gift】: As excellent sailboat gifts, this boat sculpture is very suitable for birthday, father’s day, housewarming party, wedding, or other banquet, reception, conference and nautical party, as gift for father, brother, friend, colleague, leader, captain and sailor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416++5bifHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quoowiit","source_asin":"B09JYS7TRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYS7TRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYS7TRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":634774,"name":"Signature Design by Ashley Clarinda Contemporary Tufted Wingback Accent Chair, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":204.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yN3uBGvsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One part classic slipper chair, one part traditional wingback chair and 100 percent modern. Tapered legs, clean lines and subtle tufting add fashionable flair, while the deep seat and winged back offer cozy comfort. The unique design and fabric of an arm chair or armless chair can turn it into quite a conversation piece. Our chairs are available in all different styles, sizes and shapes, with coverings that include genuine leather, microfiber or deeply tufted upholstery. You’ll find plenty of accent chairs that combine beautiful design with quality materials to create a welcoming seat. And we go the extra mile to package, protect and deliver your purchase in a timely manner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yN3uBGvsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B0BC3C29Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC3C29Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC3C29Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
