window.products.push({"id":634794,"name":"Dololoo Cheesecloth Table Runner Terracotta 35 x 118 Inches Gauze Table Runner 10Ft Burnt Orange Boho Rustic Decorations for Wedding Decor Reception B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+cDQZ-uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE：Dololoo 1 Piece extra long Cheese Gauze Table Runner. The fully expanded size is 35\" wide and 118\"length which is perfect for home decor, wedding table decorations and party table decorations. Package comes with 2 jute ropes and 2 satin ribbons. MATERIAL: This cheesecloth table runner is made from high quality premium gauze table runner with wrinkled gauze fabric. Durable, reusable and non-disposable.The cheese cloth table runner will work well in a rustic,bohemian, farmhouse, or contemporary setting. CRAFTSMANSHIP: This boho farmhouse style table runner has no frill ends. The edges are carefully stitched to keep a perfect condition. The producing process conducts crimping technique to add vintage, rustic and aesthetic beauty. WIDE APPLICATION: The rustic table runner is a great choice to decorate your table, chairs or wedding arch. Also great for bridal showers, weddings, dining tables, outdoor picnics, Christmas decorations, Thanksgiving and floral decorations. What's more, this cheesecloth runner can also be cut into gauze decorative napkins. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: The Dololoo boho table runner is a handcrafted product. Machine wash in laundry bag on gentle cycle. Maintains wrinkle texture without ironing. Extra fragrance and softener will leave a coating on your cheesecloth, do not use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+cDQZ-uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dololoo","source_asin":"B0BP1D47TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP1D47TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP1D47TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
