window.products.push({"id":634930,"name":"Remotec ZXT-600 Z-Wave Plus - IR Extender for AC Conditioner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7SG49T6L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"From the manufacturer: Headquartered in Hong Kong with additional offices in Shenzhen, China, Remotec Technology Ltd. has been the global leader in providing high quality Z-Wave, infrared and/or Bluetooth solutions, OEM/ODM services and quality home automation products. Previously known as Bondwell Computers, Remotec Technology Ltd. has been working with original equipment manufacturers, being ISO 9001:2000 certified, and having the global leaders in technology as our clients for over 25 years and continues to strive to connect the world. From the seller: ZWaveProducts is proud to be the master distributor of The Remotec products in the USA. Please feel free to contact us with any product support questions or warranty information. Product Description: ZXT-600, AC Master, is a Z-Wave plus compliant Z-Wave-to-IR Bridge to control split air conditioner by receiving Z-Wave command and translating to Infrared command. With its comprehensive built-In and cloud-stored IR database (library), ZXT-600 can control different brands and models of air conditioners worldwide. ZXT-600 is a security enabled Z-Wave plus device. A security Enabled Z-Wave Plus Controller must be used in order to fully utilize the product. ZXT-600 is a Z-Wave slave device, it depends on gateway to setup particular AC brand with correct IR code. Different gateway has different user interface for setup. Product Features and Specification: 1. Working as z Z-Wave thermostat 2. Covert Z-Wave commands to IR signal for up to 250 brand of split Air Conditioner with best class of worldwide AC model coverage 3. Ever green up-to-date cloud-based IR code library 4. Easy-to-use and advanced learning search approach 5. Room temperature feedback 6. Flawlessly work with any Z-Wave compliant gateway 7. Support classic inclusion and NWI 8. Built-in air conditioner IR codes, as well as cloud-based IR code library","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7SG49T6L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Remotec","source_asin":"B07Q41K59N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-634930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q41K59N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q41K59N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
